Sat Nov 14 12:00:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of pgModeler 2.0.0 (community build)
  * Build with GCC instead of the hard-coded clang
  * Update check disabled (updates come from the package)
  * Add a .desktop entry, icons and a MIME type for .dbm models
  * Helper programs installed with the private libraries; their
    unversioned sonames are kept out of Provides/Requires
  * Translations in a -lang subpackage
